  "pull_request": {
    "number": 155,
    "title": "fix: resolve budget.toml from workspace root instead of cwd",
    "body": "Walking up from the current directory to the workspace root ensures cargo cost-lint produces identical lint levels regardless of which member crate it is invoked from.\r\n\r\n- Add find_workspace_root_from() walking up looking for [workspace]\r\n- Change --config to Option<String> (default: None) to distinguish explicit from absent\r\n- Print 'Using config: <path>' when a config is loaded\r\n- Document the lookup rule in docs/integration.md\r\n- Add unit tests for workspace resolution, explicit paths, member dirs\r\n\r\n## Description\r\n<!-- Describe your changes in detail -->\r\n\r\n## Related Issue\r\n<!-- If this PR addresses an existing issue, please link it here. -->\r\n\r\nCloses #93 \r\n\r\n## Motivation and Context\r\n<!-- Why is this change required? What problem does it solve? -->\r\n\r\n## How Has This Been Tested?\r\n<!-- Please describe in detail how you tested your changes. -->\r\n- [ ] Added/Updated tests\r\n- [ ] Passed `cargo test`\r\n- [ ] Passed `cargo clippy`\r\n- [ ] Formatted with `cargo fmt`\r\n\r\n## Types of changes\r\n<!-- What types of changes does your code introduce? -->\r\n- [ ] Bug fix (non-breaking change which fixes an issue)\r\n- [ ] New feature (non-breaking change which adds functionality)\r\n- [ ] Breaking change (fix or feature that would cause existing functionality to change)\r\n- [ ] Documentation update\r\n",
